{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>Lips of falsehood</b> — it is a false witness." "<b>And one who does faithfulness</b> — they are the judges; HaShem is pleased with them because they do not believe false witnesses. Or 'one who does faithfulness' — they refuse to testify falsely."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:24.040785388Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}